{"id": "1791463", "name": "הרכבת פונקציות – פונקציה מקוטעת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "comp", "params": ["g", "f", "x"], "body": "at(g,x=f)"}, {"name": "gg", "params": ["x"], "body": "mm * x + nn"}, {"name": "ff1", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[ii]"}, {"name": "ff2", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[jj]"}, {"name": "ff3", "params": ["x"], "body": "ffs[kk]"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3_VISUAL_FIX_V10\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 4px;\">הרכבת פונקציות – פונקציה מקוטעת</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b;\">כל אחד מששת הרכיבים נבדק בנפרד</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px;\">הפונקציות הנתונות</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong>\\( \\displaystyle f \\)</strong> מוגדרת בשלושה קטעים:</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(170px,1fr) minmax(220px,1.3fr); gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 16px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:3}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:5}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px;\">\\( \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right)={{CT:7}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">א. חשבו את \\( \\displaystyle f\\circ g \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">תחום \\( \\displaystyle g \\) הוא \\( \\displaystyle \\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\), ותמונתה היא \\( \\displaystyle \\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:10}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle h_1\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:10}},{{CT:11}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle h_2\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:11}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle h_3\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">ב. חשבו את \\( \\displaystyle g\\circ f \\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">בסעיף זה \\( \\displaystyle g:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R} \\).</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle k_1\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle k_2\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 6px;\">\\( \\displaystyle k_3\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans6]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3_VISUAL_FIX_V10\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<p><strong>הרכבה \\( \\displaystyle f\\circ g \\):</strong> מציבים את \\( \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right) \\) בכל אחד מענפי \\( \\displaystyle f \\). נקודות המעבר מתקבלות מן הערכים שבהם \\( \\displaystyle g\\left(x\\right)=p_i \\).</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(210px,1.4fr) minmax(180px,1fr); gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:12}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:8}},{{CT:10}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:13}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:10}},{{CT:11}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:14}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:11}},{{CT:9}}\\right] \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;\">\n<p><strong>הרכבה \\( \\displaystyle g\\circ f \\):</strong> מפעילים את \\( \\displaystyle g \\) על כל אחד משלושת ענפי \\( \\displaystyle f \\), ולכן קטעי התחום נשארים כפי שהם.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(210px,1.4fr) minmax(180px,1fr); gap: 8px 18px; align-items: center; max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:15}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:16}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:2}},{{CT:4}}\\right) \\)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px; text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle {{CT:17}} \\)</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\\( \\displaystyle x\\in\\left[{{CT:4}},{{CT:6}}\\right] \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebrai